/P 134 0 R
/T (Re-rating every account to its own risk earns $2.6B of contribution, $1.5B more than doing nothing, and clears the 85% MLR ceiling with no accounts cut deliberately.)
/E (Re-rating every account to its own risk earns $2.6B of contribution, $1.5B more than doing nothing, and clears the 85% MLR ceiling with no accounts cut deliberately.)
