/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 637 0 R
/E (The book earns $2.6bn, worth $1.5bn more than doing nothing. Against a flat, do-nothing quote that erodes the book to $1.1B and lets MLR drift to 91.9%, our per account rate earns $2.6B of contribution, brings book MLR from 88.7% down to 80.9%, holds retention at 80.6%, and cuts no account deliberately. It is the only strategy we tested that lands below the 85% ceiling without shedding the book.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
